  "body": "This branch has been produced to allow a build error to be fixed.\r\n\r\nThe current `develop` branch fails `yarn install` on a `Big Sur` macos.  The branch in this PR (branched of #686) includes dependency updates, and the `yarn install` doesn't fail.\r\n\r\nBut, once we merge `develop` in, and fix the conflicts, it has two build issues.\r\n\r\n1.  `DEPRECATION WARNING`\r\n\r\n```\r\nDEPRECATION WARNING: Using / for division is deprecated and will be removed in Dart Sass 2.0.0.\r\n@serge/client: Recommendation: math.div(-1 * $size, 2)\r\n@serge/client: More info and automated migrator: https://sass-lang.com/d/slash-div\r\n@serge/client:    ╷\r\n@serge/client: 17 │   margin-top: -1 * $size/2;\r\n@serge/client:    │               ^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\n@serge/client:    ╵\r\n@serge/client:     ../components/build/local/helper-elements/collapsible/header/styles.module.scss 17:15  root stylesheet\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n2. `Typescript Error`\r\n```\r\n/Users/ian/git/serge/packages/client/src/Views/AdminAndInsightsTabsContainer/AdminAndInsightsTabsContainer.tsx\r\n@serge/client: TypeScript error in /Users/ian/git/serge/packages/client/src/Views/AdminAndInsightsTabsContainer/AdminAndInsightsTabsContainer.tsx(15,61):\r\n@serge/client: Argument of type '{ global: { tabSetTabStripHeight: number; tabEnableClose: boolean; tabEnableRenderOnDemand: boolean; }; borders: never[]; layout: { type: string; weight: number; children: never[]; }; }' is not assignable to parameter of type 'IJsonModel'.\r\n@serge/client:   The types of 'layout.type' are incompatible between these types.\r\n@serge/client:     Type 'string' is not assignable to type '\"row\"'.  TS2345\r\n@serge/client:     13 |   const state = usePlayerUiState()\r\n@serge/client:     14 |   const [byPassUrl] = useState<URL>(getByPassUrl(state))\r\n@serge/client:   > 15 |   const [model] = useState<Model>(FlexLayout.Model.fromJson(FLEX_LAYOUT_MODEL_DEFAULT))\r\n@serge/client:        |                                                             ^\r\n@serge/client:     16 |   const gameAdmin = 'Game Admin'\r\n@serge/client:     17 |   const gameAdminTitle = 'Game Admin'\r\n@serge/client:     18 |   const insights = 'Insights'\r\n\r\n```",
